Package: pichi
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dillo-vm
Description: manage and launch pichi VM images
 Pichi manages virtual machine images as OCI artifacts and launches them
 using dillo. Guest images are obtained separately.
